  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_01",
      "hash64": "39248A9414F0BA5C",
      "text": "Ah, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Wie geht’s, wie steht’s?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_02",
      "hash64": "39248D9414F0BF75",
      "text": "Bitte, was?! Jetzt sag bloß, du hast schon alle\\n400 verschiedenen Pokémon-Arten im Pokédex\\r\\nregistriert?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_03",
      "hash64": "39248C9414F0BDC2",
      "text": "WOW! Du hast echt den Pokédex vervollständigt.\\nDas ist unglaublich! Einfach atemberaubend![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_04",
      "hash64": "3924879414F0B543",
      "text": "Dank dir hat die Forschung über die Pokémon in\\nPaldea riesige Fortschritte gemacht. Danke![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_05",
      "hash64": "3924869414F0B390",
      "text": "Das hier hab ich neulich in einem etwas dubiosen\\nLaden gekauft... Da, ich schenke es dir![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_06",
      "hash64": "3924899414F0B8A9",
      "text": "Ich würde dir ja gerne zum Dank etwas Besseres\\ngeben, aber...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_01",
      "hash64": "62C3CD1975E3EB59",
      "text": "Was hat es mit all dem Krawall hier auf sich?\\nIst etwas vorgefallen?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_07",
      "hash64": "3924889414F0B6F6",
      "text": "Ah, Direktor Clavel! Sie müssen sich unbedingt\\nanhören, was [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1513,0000)]mein lieber Schülermeine liebe Schülerin hi--[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1513",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_02",
      "hash64": "62C3CA1975E3E640",
      "text": "Ist denn das die Möglichkeit?![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_03",
      "hash64": "62C3CB1975E3E7F3",
      "text": "Das ist eine wahrlich herausragende Leistung,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_08",
      "hash64": "3924939414F0C9A7",
      "text": "Ich bin auch ganz überrascht![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_04",
      "hash64": "62C3D01975E3F072",
      "text": "Das sind wahrlich ausgezeichnete Neuigkeiten,\\ndie Señor Jim sicher große Freude bereiten.\\c\\nErlaube mir, mich dafür erkenntlich zu zeigen,\\nwas du hier vollbracht hast.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_05",
      "hash64": "62C3D11975E3F225",
      "text": "Eine solche Leistung muss mit einer Urkunde\\nbelohnt werden!\\c\\nDu hast bestimmt schon eine Nachricht von der\\nFirma erhalten, die für den Pokédex zuständig ist.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_06",
      "hash64": "62C3CE1975E3ED0C",
      "text": "Ich habe deine Pokédex-App so konfiguriert,\\ndass du die Urkunde jederzeit aufrufen kannst.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_09",
      "hash64": "3924929414F0C7F4",
      "text": "Programmieren ist ein weiteres von den vielen\\nTalenten des Direktors![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_10",
      "hash64": "3921059414EDA286",
      "text": "Jedenfalls hast du wirklich phänomenale Arbeit\\ngeleistet, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_11",
      "hash64": "3921069414EDA439",
      "text": "Sollte es sich bei der Vervollständigung des\\nPokédex um deinen ganz persönlichen Schatz\\r\\ngehandelt haben, dann war deine Schatzsuche\\r\\nauf jeden Fall ein voller Erfolg![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_07",
      "hash64": "62C3CF1975E3EEBF",
      "text": "So ist es, Señor Jim. Sehr schön gesagt.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_12",
      "hash64": "3921039414ED9F20",
      "text": "Hehe... Dafür bin ich als Klassenlehrer doch da.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_13",
      "hash64": "3921049414EDA0D3",
      "text": "Du hast den Pokédex zwar vervollständigt, aber\\ndein Abenteuer ist noch lange nicht vorbei.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_14",
      "hash64": "3921099414EDA952",
      "text": "Hoffentlich begegnest du auch weiterhin vielen\\nverschiedenen Pokémon hier in Paldea![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_08",
      "hash64": "62C3D41975E3F73E",
      "text": "Ich werde auch künftig ein Auge darauf haben,\\nwie du dich schlägst. Viel Erfolg![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
